# source: crates/composition-drm/src/profile.rs, test fn dpu95_stream() and the tests that use it
# commit: 99d965d
# synthetic: written by hand, not read from a board. It carries no hardware claim.
# One output (1920x1080 @ 60 Hz) and six planes, ids 40..45: plane 40 primary, 41..45 overlays,
# zpos range 0..=5 on each (zpos_now = plane index), alpha, blend opaque/premul/coverage,
# formats ARGB8888 (AR24) and NV12, linear only. No scaling, max_source or group lines:
# `profile imx95dpu` supplies them on the core side (DriverProfile::Imx95Dpu.apply).
# Buffers 1..3 are the test's RGB, YUV and SMALL buffers. Frames: the two tests
# six_rgb_layers_fit and a_fifth_yuv_layer_has_no_fetch_unit, plus a scaled and a mixed frame.
xcheck 1
